# Admin password reset of a locked-out mechanic: the reset also ends the Identity lockout and the failure count, so the
# temporary password logs in at once. Disposable mechanic only (prefix password.reset.), registered and deleted here.

@AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress = {{$processEnv AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}
@WebUI_Origin = {{$processEnv ARSM_TEST_WEBUI_ORIGIN}}
@AdminEmail = {{$processEnv ARSM_TEST_ADMIN_EMAIL}}
@AdminPassword = {{$processEnv ARSM_TEST_ADMIN_PASSWORD}}
@TestPassword = {{$processEnv ARSM_TEST_PASSWORD}}
@TestWrongPassword = {{$processEnv ARSM_TEST_WRONG_PASSWORD}}
@TemporaryPassword = {{$processEnv ARSM_TEST_MECHANIC_NEW_PASSWORD}}
@RunId = {{$timestamp}}
@LockedMechanicEmail = password.reset.lockout.{{RunId}}@example.test

### [Setup][ResetLockout] Clear any session cookie left by a previous file (204 or 401, not asserted)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}

###

### [Setup][ResetLockout] Login as admin (200 expected)
# @name adminLogin
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{AdminEmail}}", "password": "{{AdminPassword}}" }

{{
  exports.CsrfToken = response.headers['set-cookie']?.find(c => c.startsWith('__Host-arsm-csrf-token='))?.match(/^__Host-arsm-csrf-token=([^;]+)/)?.[1];
}}

?? status == 200

###

### [Setup][ResetLockout] Register the disposable mechanic that gets locked out (200 expected)
# @name lockedMechanic
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "firstName": "Locked", "lastName": "Reset", "email": "{{LockedMechanicEmail}}", "password": "{{TestPassword}}", "personType": "Mechanic", "specialization": "GasolineAndDiesel", "expertise": ["Engine"] }

?? status == 200

###

### [Setup][ResetLockout] Six wrong passwords lock the account (401 expected each)
# @no-cookie-jar
# @loop for 6
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{LockedMechanicEmail}}", "password": "{{TestWrongPassword}}" }

?? status == 401

###

### [Negative][ResetLockout] The locked account refuses even its right password (401 expected)
# @no-cookie-jar
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{LockedMechanicEmail}}", "password": "{{TestPassword}}" }

?? status == 401

###

### [Positive][ResetLockout] Admin resets the locked mechanic's password (200 expected)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/admin/mechanics/{{lockedMechanic.personId}}/password-reset
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "temporaryPassword": "{{TemporaryPassword}}" }

?? status == 200
?? js (response.parsedBody.emailSent === false) == true

###

### [Positive][ResetLockout] The temporary password logs in right away: the reset ended the lockout (200 expected)
# @no-cookie-jar
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{LockedMechanicEmail}}", "password": "{{TemporaryPassword}}" }

?? status == 200
?? js response.parsedBody.mustChangePassword == true

###

### [Cleanup][ResetLockout] Delete the disposable mechanic with the admin session (200 expected)
DELETE {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/admin/mechanics/{{lockedMechanic.personId}}
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}

?? status == 200
